`Filters`

Filters help prevent spam and raiding, so that's why filters are in place.
Note that tripping the filter will cause such things to happen, or even saying a filtered word.

Filtered words contain death threats, slurs
## Filtered words:
- Racial slurs (N-word, variations and Racist groups)
- Homo/Transphobic slurs (F-slur, T-slur)
- Death threads (any way of telling someone to commit)
- Certain slurs/swears listed here: (R-word, Mentions of rape)
-# Bypassing these filters or finding loopholes via new slurs will result on the same punishment as saying the one above
-# Due to a loophole, putting a filtered word as your username will result in execution (Instant ban)

- Saying a filtered word = **1 day mute**
- Bypassing a filtered word = **verbal warning**, and the bypassed word will be added to the filter.
- Bypassing a filtered word multiple times = **Warn + 3 day mute**
- Bypassing a filtered word multiple times + Rule 2 breakings = **PERMA BAN**

Joking about a filter (example: `This song is ass, kys /j`) will still count as being serious, seriously don't joke about it.
